montyBoxOldT -- full monty step 3, group 2 (2026-11-28): drawWalk, drawKids and tsBoxWarn are marked newRoad in incant/utilities.

One of four twins beside montyNewT (group 1's file, which shows firstLight as it is). Each puts a registry of OLD-ROAD
copies (the same bodies, unmarked, their filtered for loops in the old road's spelling: the word after the semicolon)
ahead of Utilities before the first show: montyOld2T copies all three, montyWalkOldT, montyKidsOldT and montyBoxOldT
one each. The harness (genLadder/formsPop.sh) arms INCANT_NEWROAD_CALLS and reads, per run: how many calls of each
body went through the new-road reader (drawWalk 1, drawKids 8, tsBoxWarn 1, or 0 where its old copy answered), and
the PDF with its dates and trailer ID blanked. Every run's PDF must be the same bytes. A count of 0 where a call is
wanted fails by name: that run measured the old road. The harness also checks that each copy here is still the text
of utilities' body, the mark and the loop's spelling aside.
